\n                        </div><!-- end row -->\n                    </div> <!-- col-12-->\n                    <div class = \"col-12\">\n                        <div class = \"row g-0\">\n                                                            <div class = \"col-sm-12 p-0\">                                \n                                    <!-- Events Venue -->\n                                    <div class = \"d-flex align-items-center eventVenue\" id=\"eventVenueId-297580\">\n                                        <i class=\"rhp-events-icon location\"></i>\n                                        <div class=\"rhpVenueContent\">\n                                            <a class=\"venueLink\" href=\"https://ashevillemusichall.com/venue/asheville-music-hall-live-music/\" title=\"Asheville Music Hall\" >Asheville Music Hall</a>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div><!-- end venue -->                                \n                                </div><!-- end col-sm-12 -->\n                                                                                                                                                <!-- Room Integration End -->\n                             \n                                <div class = \" col-12 p-0 mt-4 \">\n                                    <ul class=\"rhpSocialIcons singleSocialIcon list-inline mb-0\">\n                                          \n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                                                            <div class = \"col-sm-12 px-0 singleEventDescription emptyDesc\">\n                                <p dir=\"ltr\">A man walks barefoot through the snow, takes a long bath in an icy river, then searches Craigslist for new-in-box cassette tapes from the early 90&rsquo;s.&nbsp;</p>\n<div><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">He lights a candle, loads the tape, and waits.</p>\n<div><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">He&rsquo;s listening for something unknown, yet familiar: the edge.</p>\n<div><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">This is a man staring down midlife with a renewed sense of vision, a recently unearthed Tascam Portastudio, and a call to embody masculine vulnerability through rock and roll song.</p>\n<div><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">In other words&hellip;Theo Katzman is returning to his singer-songwriter roots, with a series of intimate solo performances across the globe.</p>\n<div><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">He aims to pierce your heart.</p>\n<div><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">His aim is true.</p>\n<div><strong id=\"docs-internal-guid-9370af33-7fff-b42d-61a1-0e62dd0141ee\"></strong></div>\n                                </div><!-- end col-sm-12 - end description -->\n                        </div><!-- end row -->\n                    </div><!-- end col-12 -->\n                </div><!-- end contentBox-->\n            </div><!-- end single event details -->\n                        <!-- info section  -->\n                            <div class = \"col-12 p-md-0 singleAccordion px-md-4 infoAccordions\">\n                     <!-- end for each loop -->\n                </div><!-- end info section -->\n            \n            <!-- Perfomer Section -->\n                    </div><!-- end single event details-->\n        <!-- Single Event image-->\n        <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6 float-left \">\n            <div class = \"singleEventSection p-md-4 p-lg-4 sps sps--abv\">\n                <div class=\"col-12 p-0 d-none d-lg-block\">\n                    <div class = \"rhp-events-event-image position-relative z-index-0\">\n                        <img src=\"https://ashevillemusichall.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/theo-katzman.jfif\" title=\"Theo Katzman\" alt='Theo Katzman' />\n                                            </div>\n                </div>