ck and grunge icons through a fearless, instrumental lens&mdash;transforming the music of Nirvana, Soundgarden, Alice in Chains, Smashing Pumpkins, and Queens of the Stone Age into atmospheric, groove-driven arrangements. 90&rsquo;s nostalgia is dominating the zeitgeist and The Contraband is bringing their own spin to the era&rsquo;s most iconic music.</span></div>\n                                </div><!-- end col-sm-12 - end description -->\n                        </div><!-- end row -->\n                    </div><!-- end col-12 -->\n                </div><!-- end contentBox-->\n            </div><!-- end single event details -->\n                        <!-- info section  -->\n                            <div class = \"col-12 p-md-0 singleAccordion px-md-4 infoAccordions\">\n                     <!-- end for each loop -->\n                </div><!-- end info section -->\n            \n            <!-- Perfomer Section -->\n                    </div><!-- end single event details-->\n        <!-- Single Event image-->\n        <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6 float-left \">\n            <div class = \"singleEventSection p-md-4 p-lg-4 sps sps--abv\">\n                <div class=\"col-12 p-0 d-none d-lg-block\">\n                    <div class = \"rhp-events-event-image position-relative z-index-0\">\n                        <img src=\"https://ashevillemusichall.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/jk-the-contraband.jfif\" title=\"JK &amp; The Contraband\" alt='JK &amp; The Contraband' />\n                                            </div>\n                </div><!-- end col-12 -->\n                <!-- Event CTA -->\n                            \n                <div class = \"col-12 p-0 ctaBox d-lg-block d-md-none\">\n                    <span id=\"ctaspan-311415\" class=\"rhp-event-cta on-sale\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-md d-block w-100\"   target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external\" title=\"Get Tickets\" href=\"https://www.etix.com/ticket/p/71520494/jk-the-contraband-ashevi